
[00:00.40]I am very wild
[00:02.38]I am never mild
[00:04.23]I have a very sharp sight
[00:06.97]And very swift flight
[00:10.93]I feed nestlings with bits of food
[00:17.03]when they are quiet
[00:18.71]And also good
[00:20.46]Yes you don’t see me often cause
[00:23.00]I rarely come where people live
[00:26.12]For I am out of bounds

